00:42:59.724 --> 00:43:01.101
Pero kahit ganoon ay pumayag pa rin siya.

00:43:03.645 --> 00:43:07.148
Kung sasabihin mong hindi, hindi ko gagawin.

00:43:07.982 --> 00:43:09.859
Lalabas din naman 'yan kahit papaano.

00:43:11.736 --> 00:43:13.655
Si Kang Min-woo, ang lalaking iyon,

00:43:14.656 --> 00:43:16.324
